    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nGround floor two bedroom apartment with rear south-east facing patio, in this prestigious Rosslare Strand well managed gated estate.No. 8 is spacious and situated just off the sought after Strand Road, so it's within a short stroll of all the amenities on offer including Kelly's Resort Hotel, the famous Rosslare Strand Golf Links, the notorious Blue Flag Strand and numerous restaurants and shops.Accommodation includes a large open plan living-dining area, separate kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms (master ensuite). The entrance is shared with three other apartments.The real bonus here is the rear patio area which opens up onto a green area. Aspect wise it is perfect as it catches the sun throughout the day and is perfect for BBQ's and sitting out relaxing"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.46m x 1.14m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nHall - 4.84m 1.14m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 5.17m x 4.85m\nWith tiled flooring, open fireplace and access to rear patio and garden area which attracts most of the afternoon sunshine.\n\nKitchen - 2.56m x 2.47m\nWith waist and eye level storage, tiled flooring and splashbacks and access to livingroom.\n\nBathroom - 2.69m x 2.14m\nWith tiled flooring and part tiled walls, bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nHot Press - \n\n\nBedroom 1 Ensuite - 3.4m x 3m\nWith tiled flooring and Bay Window.\n\nEnsuite - 1.77m x 1.52m\nWith tiled flooring and part tiled walls, Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 2.4m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\n"
      },
